takeover
expect walk
shot keys-1-walk
view 5
expect held
takeover
expect free
shot keys-5-free
free
expect walk
wait 1
shot keys-5-landed
free
expect free
fly 2 -20
fly 2 10
shot keys-flown
mark flown
view 2
expect held
takeover
expect walk
wait 0.5
shot keys-2-walk
view 6
expect held
takeover
expect walk
wait 0.5
shot keys-6-walk
view 7
expect held
takeover
expect walk
wait 0.5
shot keys-7-walk
view 8
expect held
takeover
expect walk
wait 0.5
shot keys-8-walk
view 9
expect held
takeover
expect walk
wait 0.5
shot keys-9-walk
view 3
takeover
mark the street view (3)
view 4
takeover
mark into12 (4)
end
